	</StorytellerDef>
	
		<StorytellerDef ParentName="BaseStoryteller">
		<defName>OA_RK_Penoy</defName>
		<label>"The Squire" Paeonia</label>
		<description>As the eldest daughter of the Squire Clan, Paeonia has followed her parents around the palace for as long as she can remember, learning how to serve the master's family. After she formally followed her master's family, she managed to keep their lives in order and became their most trusted squire. \n\n Most of the stories she recounts are on the daily side, tedious and plain, but easy to adapt to. \n\n It's very easy for minor threats and other trivial things to happen here, while large threats such as assaults are rare and low-intensity, so there's no need to worry about adapting to them.</description>
		<portraitLarge>Storyteller/Peony</portraitLarge>
